  "details": "I'm begging that you guys add an option to remove the awful dotted lines that point to a pickup, and the outline of the pickups themselves. You have an option to remove pickup haptics in accessibility so I don't understand why outlines can't be hidden in HUD settings.\n\nIt massively kills my immersion to have constant blue outlines everywhere, it's just ugly also :/ I get it helps people that have accessibility problems, but some of us just don't need it and want to turn it off.",
